<article class="env-lemma" id="0825">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0825">Lemma <span data-tag="0825">67.48.10</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $f : Y \to X$ be an integral morphism of algebraic spaces over $S$. Then the integral closure of $X$ in $Y$ is equal to $Y$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      By Lemma <a href="/tag/0415" data-tag="0415">67.45.7</a> this is a special case of Lemma <a href="/tag/0A0Q" data-tag="0A0Q">67.48.9</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>